{
  "_about": "Phone ke background scanner (WhatsApp/SMS notifications) ke rules. Ye server ke scam_patterns.json se alag aur zyada sakht hain, kyunke ye har aane wale message par khud chalte hain. Phone inhe /v1/rules se download karta hai.",
  "_how_to_change": "Rule badalne/add karne ke baad `python -m unittest tests.test_phone_rules` aur `python -m tests.test_group_messages` chalayein. EVERYDAY_MESSAGES par koi alert nahi aana chahiye. `version` khud banta hai — yahan na likhein.",
  "schema": 1,
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "whatsapp_ban_hoax",
      "keywords": [
        "whatsapp",
        "ban",
        "verification",
        "code",
        "24 hour",
        "band",
        "recover",
        "forward"
      ],
      "min_match": 3,
      "anchors": [
        "verification code",
        "24 hour",
        "recover",
        "band"
      ],
      "label": "WhatsApp account ban hoax — verification code mangna hijacking attempt hai"
    },
